id windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"29%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Undetermined</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><sup><span lang=\"EN-GB\">a</span></sup><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">DICER1</span></em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">-associated sarcomas, regardless of the site of origin, exhibit similar and characteristic histology and closely resemble p<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">leuropulmonary blastoma</span>. The use of a unified nomenclature to describe these lesions has been proposed </span><span class=\"Ref-PMID\" style=\"color: #984806; background: #ccc0d9;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">{32572152; 33825038}</span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">.</span></p>",
